# Module facade (vcl-forntend)

Trong repo target `vcl-forntend`, mỗi feature:

```
src/modules/<feature>/
  index.js     ← UI chỉ import đây
  api.js
  mock.js
  mappers.js
  seed.js      ← optional
```

```js
import { isMockMode } from "@/utils/mocks/dataSource";
import { listXApi } from "./api";
import { listXMock } from "./mock";

export async function listX(params) {
  if (isMockMode()) return listXMock(params);
  return listXApi(params);
}
```

- Export: verb + noun — không suffix `Service`.
- HTTP qua `apiRequest` → `/api/*`.
- Tham chiếu tốt trên target: `src/modules/restricted-items/`.

Skill: `wire-module-mock-api`.
